  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3865,
      "text": "and made his offspring[19] the only survivors,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3866,
      "text": "and We left for him [a favorable mention] among later generations:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3867,
      "text": "“Peace be upon Noah among all the nations.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3868,
      "text": "This is how We reward those who do good.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3869,
      "text": "He was one of Our believing slaves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3870,
      "text": "Then we drowned the others.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 179,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3871,
      "text": "Indeed, Abraham was one of those who followed his way.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3872,
      "text": "When he came to his Lord with a sound heart,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3873,
      "text": "and said to his father and his people, “What are you worshiping?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3874,
      "text": "Is it false gods that you seek other than Allah?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3875,
      "text": "Then what do you think of the Lord of the worlds?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3876,
      "text": "He then cast a glance at the stars[20],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3877,
      "text": "and said, “I am sick[21].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3878,
      "text": "So they went away from him and left.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 90,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3879,
      "text": "Then he turned to their gods and said, “Why do you not eat[22]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 91,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3880,
      "text": "What is wrong with you that you do not speak?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3881,
      "text": "Then he turned upon them, striking them with his right hand.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3882,
      "text": "Then his people came rushing towards him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3883,
      "text": "He said, “Do you worship what you yourselves carve,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 95,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3884,
      "text": "when it is Allah Who created you and all what you do?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 96,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3885,
      "text": "They said, “Build a pyre for him and throw him into the blazing fire.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 97,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3886,
      "text": "They contrived a plan against him, but We made them the lowest.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 98,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3887,
      "text": "He said, “I am going to my Lord; He will guide me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 99,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3888,
      "text": "My Lord, grant me righteous offspring.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 100,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3889,
      "text": "So We gave him glad tidings of a forbearing boy[23].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 101,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 449,
      "ruku": 388,
      "hizbQuarter": 180,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3890,
      "text": "Then when he reached the age where he could work with him, Abraham said, “O my dear son, I have seen in a dream that I must sacrifice you. What do you think?” He said, “O my dear father, do as you are commanded. You will find me, if Allah wills, one of the steadfast.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
